<title>ITALY: Italy's state debt at 2,242.8 trln in March-BOI.</title>
<headline>Italy's state debt at 2,242.8 trln in March-BOI.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's state debt stood at 2,242.8 trillion in March, compared with 2,218.2 trillion in February and 2,115.8 trillion a year ago, the Bank of Italy said in a report on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
